00:17.240 --> 00:19.530
<i>Accessories, maybe?</i>

00:20.740 --> 00:24.400
<i>She's always wearing earrings, after all.</i>

00:25.200 --> 00:27.140
Thank you very much!

00:29.770 --> 00:31.680
<i>I couldn't help but buy them.</i>

00:33.230 --> 00:35.800
