02:24.990 --> 02:29.070
<b>Youth Starts 
With Pure White</b>

02:24.990 --> 02:30.990
<b>Youth Starts 
With Pure White</b>

02:25.190 --> 02:27.570
<i>That'd be a dream come true!</i>

02:29.420 --> 02:31.000
Sorry to keep you waiting.

02:33.160 --> 02:35.120
<i>It lived up to the hype.</i>

02:38.170 --> 02:40.170
Great weather, huh?

02:40.170 --> 02:43.020
Yeah, look at all that snow!

02:43.020 --> 02:45.380
<i>Skiing with Fuyutsuki-san!</i>

02:46.920 --> 02:48.520
Ski! Ski!

02:48.520 --> 02:51.690
<i>The four of us came here to ski together.</i>

02:54.530 --> 02:56.600
<i>It all started one week ago.</i>

02:57.280 --> 03:02.280
<b>You Won!</b>

02:57.530 --> 02:59.190
Fuyutsuki-san!

02:59.920 --> 03:02.280
Look at this!

03:02.280 --> 03:03.620
Ta-da!

03:02.280 --> 03:04.780
<b>You Won!</b>

03:03.960 --> 03:06.750
I won the big prize!

03:06.750 --> 03:08.780
Come with me, okay?

03:09.280 --> 03:13.340
I've never been skiing before.

03:13.340 --> 03:15.820
Maybe you should invite 
someone else instead.

03:15.820 --> 03:18.800
Aw, but I don't wanna!

03:19.320 --> 03:22.800
If you've never been, 
that's all the more reason to go!

03:22.800 --> 03:26.500
You'll make so many new discoveries!

03:27.810 --> 03:31.150
If it's fun, you'll have new discoveries...

03:31.150 --> 03:33.560
And even if it's super boring,

03:33.560 --> 03:36.000
you'll still have new discoveries!

03:37.140 --> 03:38.570
I see.

03:38.570 --> 03:40.370
I'll go, then.

03:40.370 --> 03:42.560
Yes!

03:43.690 --> 03:45.570
Good morning.

03:46.270 --> 03:49.730
Himuro-kun! Good morning!

03:49.730 --> 03:51.580
Good morning.

03:51.850 --> 03:54.840
Himuro-kun, do you ski?

03:55.680 --> 03:57.320
I do.

03:57.320 --> 03:59.200
Really?!

03:59.200 --> 04:00.340
In that case...

04:00.590 --> 04:05.340
Would you teach Fuyutsuki-san how to ski?

04:10.360 --> 04:12.940
<i>Skiing with Fuyutsuki-san?!</i>

04:13.880 --> 04:15.350
Morning, all.

04:15.610 --> 04:16.630
I know!

04:16.630 --> 04:18.010
As long as we're going,

04:18.010 --> 04:21.360
let's make it a group outing 
and have a Christmas party!

04:23.640 --> 04:25.620
Christmas will be...

04:25.840 --> 04:28.840
a group ski trip!

04:37.840 --> 04:40.680
I need to make sure you're locked in.

04:40.680 --> 04:43.310
Would you mind raising your feet for me?

04:43.310 --> 04:44.380
Right.

04:50.000 --> 04:51.600
What do you think?

04:51.600 --> 04:53.400
Looks perfect!

04:53.400 --> 04:55.710
<i>Skiing with the girl I'm sweet on!</i>

04:55.710 --> 04:56.920
<i>To think...</i>

04:56.920 --> 05:00.050
<i>To think my life would ever be so blessed!</i>

05:00.050 --> 05:03.400
<i>What a funny thought, too!</i>

05:03.400 --> 05:05.400
<i>Taking my sugar out on the powder!</i>

05:05.400 --> 05:08.400
Um, Himuro-kun...

05:08.400 --> 05:10.920
R-Right!

05:10.920 --> 05:12.830
I'm sorry.

05:12.830 --> 05:14.900
I feel like I dragged you into this...

05:15.270 --> 05:18.410
Not at all. I'm not too 
shabby at this, after all.

05:18.880 --> 05:22.310
I leave myself in your care, then.

05:24.500 --> 05:25.560
Right!

05:27.580 --> 05:30.450
We'll start with the basics, okay?

05:30.760 --> 05:31.930
All right.

05:31.930 --> 05:35.920
I want you to shoosh forward, 
then whoop to stop.

05:36.240 --> 05:38.880
Shoosh? Whoop?

05:39.350 --> 05:41.060
I'll show you.

05:42.440 --> 05:45.950
"Shoosh" forward...

05:49.160 --> 05:51.270
Then "whoop" to stop.

05:53.070 --> 05:54.950
Amazing.

05:55.520 --> 05:57.170
It's easy!

05:57.680 --> 05:59.460
Go on!

06:10.010 --> 06:11.250
Whoop.

06:17.020 --> 06:19.480
<i>Too darn cute!</i>

06:19.480 --> 06:23.970
Um... I'm sorry. I messed up the shoosh.

06:24.430 --> 06:25.720
<i>Drat!</i>

06:25.720 --> 06:30.050
<i>Because I grew up with skiing, 
I dunno how to teach!</i>

06:30.050 --> 06:33.990
<i>And I fell into explainin' with 
Kansai-style feel-based directions!</i>

06:34.430 --> 06:36.790
<i>If you just vroosh down 
this road you'll go bam,</i>

06:36.790 --> 06:39.000
<i>so skrrt around right there instead!</i>

06:42.410 --> 06:44.310
Grab on!

06:44.600 --> 06:46.760
R-Right.

06:46.760 --> 06:49.210
I'll pull you up!

06:50.840 --> 06:52.760
Thank you very much.

06:54.080 --> 06:59.280
First thing, focus on leaning your 
weight forward so you don't pitch over.

07:02.100 --> 07:03.760
Weight forward...

07:03.760 --> 07:05.510
Yeah, like that!

07:05.510 --> 07:11.060
And if you tilt your skis in like this, 
you'll go slower, so it's not too scary!

07:11.840 --> 07:13.310
Tilt them in...

07:14.150 --> 07:16.390
Looking great!

07:16.390 --> 07:20.750
Keep them just like that, and shift your 
center of gravity just a bit forward...

07:20.750 --> 07:22.120
Center of gravity...

07:25.460 --> 07:27.120
How's it feel?

07:27.120 --> 07:29.290
Try skiing a bit on your own!

07:29.920 --> 07:30.920
Okay!

07:33.920 --> 07:37.300
That's the way! Looking good!

07:38.580 --> 07:41.350
Yeah! Keep it up!

07:39.180 --> 07:41.350
Himuro-san, hang in there!

07:53.320 --> 07:55.210
Wow, awesome!

07:55.210 --> 07:57.890
You're a real skiier already!

07:58.320 --> 08:01.320
Yeah, that's pretty impressive.

08:01.320 --> 08:02.890
<i>Magnificent!</i>

08:01.320 --> 08:05.330
Wow! A blizzard!

08:05.660 --> 08:08.330
<i>Himuro-san's in top form today.</i>

08:12.790 --> 08:17.170
Now that Fuyutsuki-san's got the hang of it,

08:17.170 --> 08:19.840
why don't we go up the slope together?

08:19.840 --> 08:23.120
I hear the day lodge up 
there serves great curry.

08:23.120 --> 08:26.360
Then let's take a break up there.

08:31.640 --> 08:33.210
Tracks...

08:33.210 --> 08:34.870
Hey, yeah.

08:34.870 --> 08:37.730
Do you think they belong to a fox?

08:37.730 --> 08:42.370
Oh, yeah. Looks like my mom's tracks.

08:42.370 --> 08:43.120
What?

08:43.720 --> 08:46.880
<i>Is her mother... fluffy?</i>

08:47.190 --> 08:48.680
Welcome home!

08:48.680 --> 08:50.870
Dinner's on the table!

08:50.870 --> 08:56.030
Um... Could I come over to meet her sometime?

08:57.100 --> 08:58.880
I was just kidding.

08:58.880 --> 09:01.880
She's a normal old lady.

09:02.200 --> 09:04.170
You really believed that?

09:07.890 --> 09:09.030
Say...

09:09.030 --> 09:14.850
I'm pretty curious about 
what your family is like.

09:14.850 --> 09:18.530
My parents are both ordinary office workers.

09:18.530 --> 09:21.240
<i>Ordinary office workers?</i>

09:22.470 --> 09:25.040
And my little sister's just a student.

09:25.040 --> 09:28.910
Wow, you've got a little sister?

09:28.910 --> 09:30.050
Yes.

09:30.390 --> 09:32.240
<i>A little sister...</i>

09:32.240 --> 09:34.140
<i>I had no idea.</i>

09:34.750 --> 09:37.990
<i>Himuro-kun and I have 
worked together for a while,</i>

09:37.990 --> 09:40.050
<i>but there's still so much 
I don't know about him.</i>

09:41.050 --> 09:42.520
That reminds me,

09:42.520 --> 09:47.430
she said she got a part-time job 
at a ski lodge for the winter...

09:47.430 --> 09:50.560
Hey, what if it was here?

09:50.560 --> 09:53.210
I'd love to meet her if that's the case!

09:53.210 --> 09:55.160
Right, Fuyutsuki-san?

09:55.160 --> 09:57.070
Oh... yes.

09:57.070 --> 10:00.660
That seems extremely unlikely.

10:01.070 --> 10:03.520
<i>Himuro-kun's little sister...</i>

10:03.930 --> 10:05.490
<i>I wonder what she's like.</i>

10:11.880 --> 10:13.880
Let's eat that curry!

10:13.880 --> 10:16.160
Sounds good to me!

10:17.440 --> 10:19.590
Welcome!

10:19.590 --> 10:21.820
Huh? Big Bro?

10:21.820 --> 10:25.080
Hang on! What're you doing here?!

10:25.470 --> 10:27.250
<i>"Big Bro"?</i>

10:28.600 --> 10:31.600
<i>Th-The unlikely happened!</i>

10:33.050 --> 10:34.710
Um...

10:35.300 --> 10:36.700
This is my sister.

10:37.610 --> 10:40.600
<i>She's</i> your little sister?!

10:40.600 --> 10:43.460
Hello, I'm Yukimin!

10:43.760 --> 10:47.610
I do modeling and streaming 
and all kinds of things!

10:47.610 --> 10:49.450
Modeling and streaming?!

10:49.450 --> 10:51.320
Wow, awesome!

10:51.320 --> 10:53.620
Yukimi! You just met them!

10:53.620 --> 10:57.020
I've got videos about dance, 
makeup, and everything!

10:57.020 --> 10:59.640
I'm actually a pretty big deal!

11:00.080 --> 11:03.040
Makeup videos?! I wanna see!

11:03.040 --> 11:05.410
What's your channel called?

11:07.060 --> 11:08.280
Sorry.

11:08.280 --> 11:10.880
I don't want IRL people to see it.

11:11.950 --> 11:15.670
Maybe "Yukimin Channel"?

11:15.670 --> 11:18.440
Whoa, look at those subscriber numbers!

11:18.440 --> 11:20.480
Wow, for real?

11:20.910 --> 11:22.490
That's amazing!

11:22.490 --> 11:24.910
Why would you need to hide this?

11:25.180 --> 11:27.580
W-Well... because...

11:27.580 --> 11:31.810
My most viewed video is about eating...

11:30.910 --> 11:33.920
<b>I Tried Eating the Super-Spicy Ramen!!!</b>

11:30.910 --> 11:33.920
<b>1st Place</b>

11:30.910 --> 11:33.920
<b>Yukimin Channel</b>

11:30.910 --> 11:33.920
<b>Spicy Eating</b>

11:31.810 --> 11:33.920
Hey, you're right.

11:34.180 --> 11:38.920
And that's not exactly what 
I want to be known for...

11:38.920 --> 11:41.220
I think it's very charming.

11:44.310 --> 11:46.390
Hey, are you...

11:46.390 --> 11:47.900
Fuyutsuki-san?

11:47.900 --> 11:48.930
Yes.

11:48.930 --> 11:50.310
I knew it!

11:50.310 --> 11:52.060
Big Bro's always talking about—

11:52.060 --> 11:52.930
Hold it.

11:54.000 --> 11:56.970
Hey, Bro! Get your dang hand offa me!

11:56.970 --> 11:59.360
You're the one actin' crazy! 
Do your dang job!

11:59.360 --> 12:02.440
Too bad! I just clocked out for my break!

12:02.440 --> 12:03.520
Right now?!

12:07.020 --> 12:08.660
Stay back, Bro!

12:09.240 --> 12:10.830
Nyeh!

12:13.960 --> 12:15.650
U-Uh...

12:15.650 --> 12:17.440
Hey, Fuyutsuki-san...

12:17.440 --> 12:19.560
I'm a little worried.

12:19.560 --> 12:20.460
What?

12:20.810 --> 12:26.250
Descendants of snow women tend 
to have rather short tempers.

12:26.250 --> 12:30.470
My brother doesn't cause 
trouble at your job, does he?

12:30.740 --> 12:33.640
<i>That's a characteristic of their people?</i>

12:34.630 --> 12:37.360
He hasn't caused any trouble.

12:37.360 --> 12:41.610
In fact, Himuro-kun is always 
very accommodating.

12:41.980 --> 12:44.480
He even taught me how to ski today.

12:44.880 --> 12:48.520
Really? He's fitting in at work?

12:49.000 --> 12:50.640
Don't worry.

12:51.780 --> 12:55.390
We're very happy to have him.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.730
Fuyutsuki-san...

13:02.630 --> 13:05.840
<i>Her eyes are the same color as Himuro-kun's.</i>

13:07.840 --> 13:09.130
<i>Beautiful.</i>

13:21.820 --> 13:23.280
I love you.

13:25.030 --> 13:26.990
Hey, you!

13:28.750 --> 13:31.410
Show some freakin' decorum, girl!

13:31.410 --> 13:32.670
Lemme go!

13:32.670 --> 13:34.530
Quit pickin' on me, Bro!

13:34.530 --> 13:39.540
<i>She better not be tryin' to get her 
paws on Fuyutsuki-san for real!</i>

13:44.810 --> 13:47.090
Merry Christmas!

13:47.520 --> 13:50.520
Fuyutsuki-san, is there 
anything I can help with?

13:48.140 --> 13:50.520
I wanna do more skiing!

13:50.510 --> 13:51.620
I'll bet.

13:50.520 --> 13:51.990
I have it covered.

13:51.990 --> 13:55.400
Himuro-kun! Why don't you make 
us some slopes at the office?

13:55.400 --> 13:56.520
He'd do it, I bet!

13:57.090 --> 14:01.030
Let us now commence 
the Christmas takoyaki party.

14:04.740 --> 14:07.440
<i>The Santa hat... Magnificent!</i>

14:08.520 --> 14:11.530
Why takoyaki on a ski trip?

14:11.770 --> 14:15.280
Because I bought a takoyaki grill recently.

14:15.840 --> 14:22.050
And the guest house has the 
cookware, so I figured, why not?

14:22.650 --> 14:26.800
<i>I was wondering why 
Fuyutsuki-san had so much luggage.</i>

14:27.400 --> 14:29.420
<i>So that's the story!</i>

14:30.300 --> 14:33.320
She's that fired up about a takoyaki party?

14:33.850 --> 14:37.320
Why not? You know it's gonna be fun!

14:37.760 --> 14:39.730
Here, Saejima-kun!

14:41.140 --> 14:45.300
Well, I guess it <i>is</i> pretty fun...

14:47.500 --> 14:51.150
The hot grill won't be 
an issue for you, will it?

14:51.150 --> 14:52.320
No.

14:52.960 --> 14:54.870
I love takoyaki!

14:55.510 --> 14:58.320
<i>I'd gladly eat anything you make!</i>

14:58.650 --> 15:00.070
I'm glad.

15:04.330 --> 15:11.340
In that case, Santa Fuyutsuki will make sure 
you get extra octopus in your takoyaki.

15:14.360 --> 15:15.800
<i>Hell yeah!</i>

15:15.800 --> 15:16.980
<i>Fuyutsuki Santa...</i>

15:16.980 --> 15:18.880
<i>More like an angel!</i>

15:18.880 --> 15:21.360
<i>I've never been happier to be alive!</i>

15:22.160 --> 15:25.410
Himuro-san, please tone it down indoors.

15:28.360 --> 15:32.360
The grill gets very hot, 
so please be careful.

15:32.890 --> 15:36.360
Let's respect the process and 
have a safe takoyaki party.

15:36.360 --> 15:39.790
Um... shouldn't we have a toast first?

15:39.790 --> 15:42.370
Oh, I'm sorry.

15:42.370 --> 15:44.500
<i>The takoyaki magistrate.</i>

15:45.700 --> 15:47.020
<i>Magnificent.</i>

16:21.420 --> 16:26.400
Huh? Looks like we're running out of booze.

16:27.160 --> 16:29.480
I'll go buy some more, then.

16:30.420 --> 16:32.750
I'll go with you.

16:32.750 --> 16:35.930
Hey, thanks a bunch!

16:39.040 --> 16:42.480
By the way, what's Nyamero 
doing while we're gone?

16:42.920 --> 16:45.310
I hired a sitter.

16:45.580 --> 16:49.150
Wow, so the house is covered, huh?

16:49.150 --> 16:51.150
Yes. Nyamero's a very responsible cat.

17:05.940 --> 17:07.240
Beautiful.

17:08.460 --> 17:11.480
Yes... it is.

17:14.460 --> 17:15.870
Fuyutsuki-san!

17:16.960 --> 17:19.490
Er... for you.

17:31.400 --> 17:32.990
What is this?

17:32.990 --> 17:35.800
Well, it <i>is</i> Christmas and all...

17:36.200 --> 17:40.490
So Santa Himuro... well... you know.

17:40.490 --> 17:42.350
Himuro-kun...

17:45.360 --> 17:46.920
A blanket.

17:48.590 --> 17:51.840
I didn't get you anything.

17:51.840 --> 17:54.000
Yet you did this for me...

17:54.350 --> 17:59.000
Because I'm always causing 
blizzards at the office...

17:59.000 --> 18:01.650
It doesn't bother me at all.

18:03.320 --> 18:06.080
Any time I'm with you...

18:06.970 --> 18:10.520
I feel strangely warm inside.

18:15.350 --> 18:16.570
Thank you.

18:16.900 --> 18:19.920
Why are you thanking me?

18:21.040 --> 18:24.480
Well... that's a good question.

18:24.480 --> 18:26.610
I just wanted to say it, I suppose.

18:26.960 --> 18:30.230
I should be the one thanking you, 
of course. Thank you.

18:43.190 --> 18:46.000
They've been gone a while.

18:46.000 --> 18:49.350
Well, I'm sure they're just fine.

18:49.350 --> 18:52.020
The snow is beautiful, isn't it?

18:58.020 --> 19:01.020
Yes. Very beautiful.

19:29.440 --> 19:32.190
Really? No way!

19:32.190 --> 19:35.950
There's nothing worse than getting 
accessories you didn't ask for!

19:35.950 --> 19:37.490
Totally.

19:37.490 --> 19:40.690
And it feels so pushy if we're not dating.

19:41.480 --> 19:43.630
<i>C-Crud!</i>

19:43.630 --> 19:45.700
<i>I gotta buy somethin' less pushy...</i>

19:51.040 --> 19:53.530
It's very warm.

19:58.140 --> 20:01.100
Um... I'm very sorry.

20:01.470 --> 20:03.840
My sister was rather obnoxious yesterday.

20:04.460 --> 20:05.870
Not at all.

20:05.870 --> 20:08.800
She was a very nice girl.

20:09.160 --> 20:13.380
She even asked how things 
were going for you at work.

20:13.380 --> 20:14.850
I'm sorry.

20:17.850 --> 20:22.850
You seem to act a bit differently 
when she's around.

20:23.120 --> 20:25.110
Do I?

20:25.110 --> 20:28.540
It was nice to see you out of office mode.

20:29.420 --> 20:31.730
Himuro-kun as a big brother...

20:32.460 --> 20:35.120
Himuro-kun as a skiing expert...

20:36.410 --> 20:38.130
I made many new discoveries.

20:38.880 --> 20:41.620
I'm very glad we came on this ski trip.

20:43.110 --> 20:44.800
I'm flattered.

20:48.020 --> 20:49.750
This bus is cold.

20:49.750 --> 20:51.550
Goodness me!

21:01.230 --> 21:02.650
<b><u></u></b>Big Bro_______________
You have a new message.

21:05.530 --> 21:07.150
Big Bro?

21:08.660 --> 21:12.660
<b>Good job!!</b>

21:09.640 --> 21:11.000
<i>"Good job!"</i>

21:13.200 --> 21:14.370
Gross.

21:14.370 --> 21:16.340
What's he even talking about?

21:16.340 --> 21:18.160
I'll leave him on read.

21:20.480 --> 21:23.200
<i>It's been a pretty nice Christmas.</i>

21:26.470 --> 21:32.010
